    <node id="The Spirit">
      <data key="d0">The Spirit</data>
      <data key="d1">spirit</data>
      <data key="d2">The Spirit is a supernatural entity that appears to Scrooge, guiding him through various locations and events from his past.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is an otherworldly being that appears and interacts with Scrooge during Christmas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is likely a reference to the Ghost of Christmas Present, guiding Scrooge through his past experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is an entity that appears to Scrooge, initially surprising him.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is a supernatural entity that appears to Scrooge and shows him visions of Christmas celebrations past, present, and future.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is a supernatural visitor that appears to Scrooge during Christmas time.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is a supernatural entity sent to guide Scrooge and show him visions of the future.</data>
