      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A spirit who visited Scrooge to convey a warning about his life choices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost is a supernatural entity that appears to Scrooge and tells him about his past.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost appears to Ebenezer Scrooge and shows him visions of his past.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost appears to Scrooge, forcing him to witness various scenes from his past life.</data>
