    <node id="Ghost of Christmas Present">
      <data key="d0">Ghost of Christmas Present</data>
      <data key="d1">supernaturalentity</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ghost of Christmas Present is a benevolent spirit who shows Scrooge how others celebrate Christmas and the joy it brings them.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Present is a supernatural being who guides Scrooge through his experience on Christmas Day.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Present is one of the three spirits who visits Ebenezer Scrooge, symbolizing joy and generosity during the holiday season.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Present reveals to Scrooge how others perceive him and the consequences of his behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Present shows Scrooge the joy and suffering of those around him, including Bob Cratchit's family.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5f14044ab5836af865c1e895c3e69f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a39495d7b79a72917d7f65a38a5e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd7ea7800427decdc6ca6423c069cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9734fe4802f9c8f1d9eb812bf4e03f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b1f20d45706bc18474add4f6ec6ab5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9815eafa59fa78a659aa70c67cf7c1f</data>
