      <data key="d2">Master Peter is another of Bob's sons, who is proud to be dressed in his father's old shirt collar.&lt;SEP&gt;Master Peter Cratchit is the son of Bob and Mrs. Cratchit, who is being celebrated by his siblings.</data>
