    <node id="Ghost">
      <data key="d0">Ghost</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ghost, also known as Marley's Ghost, appears to Scrooge and warns him about his future.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost appears to Scrooge, rebuking him for his behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost is a supernatural entity that conducts Scrooge through different scenes to show him visions of Christmas past, present, and future.</data>
