      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Peter Cratchit is a young boy who participates in the Cratchit family's Christmas celebration.&lt;SEP&gt;Peter Cratchit is Bob's son who reads a book about Jesus and helps to bring comfort to his family during difficult times.&lt;SEP&gt;Peter Cratchit is the eldest son of the Cratchit family, who is working as an office clerk.&lt;SEP&gt;Peter Cratchit is the eldest son of the Cratchit family and will eventually leave home to set up his own life.</data>
