      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">London is the city where Scrooge resides and works.&lt;SEP&gt;London is the city where Scrooge grew up and experienced many events from his past.&lt;SEP&gt;The story takes place in London during the Christmas season.&lt;SEP&gt;London is a city where the story takes place and is associated with various settings, including streets and markets.</data>
