    <node id="Fred">
      <data key="d0">Fred</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Fred, or Scrooge's nephew, is known for his sense of humor and kindness towards others.&lt;SEP&gt;Fred is a character in the story who participates in the Yes and No game with Scrooge's nephew.&lt;SEP&gt;Fred is Scrooge's nephew, who is initially surprised by his uncle's visit but welcomes him warmly.&lt;SEP&gt;Fred is Scrooge's nephew who invites him to dinner, prompting a change in Scrooge's behavior.</data>
