      <data key="d1">spirit</data>
      <data key="d2">Jacob Marley's ghost is the spirit of Ebenezer Scrooge's former business partner, condemned to wander the earth wearing heavy chains.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob Marley's Ghost is the supernatural entity that visits Ebenezer Scrooge to warn him of his impending fate and offer him a chance to change his ways.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-077296ef9d26ac7523cc35de962fe15a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a39495d7b79a72917d7f65a38a5e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a76055a2c7afe2fed010f2b31fbb8c4</data>
