      <data key="d1">spirit</data>
      <data key="d2">The Third Spirit embodies truth, wisdom, and enlightenment, guiding Ebenezer Scrooge towards a more profound understanding of himself and his place in society.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-077296ef9d26ac7523cc35de962fe15a</data>
