    <edge source="Scrooge" target="Ghost of Christmas Past">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Ghost of Christmas Past continues to interact with Scrooge, sharing memories from his past.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrooge watches the party through the Ghost of Christmas Past's eyes and becomes aware of its presence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Past guides Scrooge through his past experiences, influencing his emotional state.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost's visit reminds Scrooge of past memories associated with Christmas, evoking a softer emotional response within him as he begins to reconsider his behavior towards others during the holiday.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Present appears to Scrooge, leading to his transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Past shows Scrooge scenes from his past, leading to reflection and potential change.&lt;SEP&gt;The visit from the Ghost of Christmas Past makes Scrooge regret his past actions and leads to a change of heart.</data>
      <data key="d9">change of heart,emotional impact,emotional response,guidance,memory revelation,observer,past experiences,personal growth,regret,spirit interaction,spiritual presence,supernatural encounter,supernatural interaction,transformation</data>
