    <edge source="Bob Cratchit" target="Tiny Tim">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Bob struggles to provide for his son Tiny Tim, who suffers from a debilitating illness that has left him unable to walk or play with other children.&lt;SEP&gt;Bob is very proud of Tiny Tim's resilience and determination despite his physical disability.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiny Tim's father Bob is very close to him and loves him dearly.&lt;SEP&gt;Bob Cratchit takes care of Tiny Tim during the dinner, placing him beside him in a tiny corner at the table.&lt;SEP&gt;Bob Cratchit loves his son Tiny Tim despite his illness and tries to be optimistic about their situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Bob loves his son Tiny Tim and is concerned about his health.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiny Tim and Bob Cratchit share a strong family bond as they express their love for each other.</data>
      <data key="d9">affection,assistance,caregiving,emotional connection,family bond,family relationship,father-son relationship,illness,parent-child relationship</data>
